{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d2935afe82cf29fb","name":"MorningStar-B Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-d2935afe82cf29fb","title":"MorningStar-B Starfighter","revision":19995,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:00:01Z","sha256":"5c6d2ac8ebbd6c3398de52f4444b11a70f42f4d6bdd4bc5b7c4dc3353e1d2eb7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19995","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=MorningStar-B%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d2935afe82cf29fb","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The MorningStar is a tri-wing Starfighter used extensively in mercenary fleets prior to the Invasion of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},". The Trade Federation employs several mercenary groups that use the MorningStar fighter and its variants. Of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," available prior to the Galactic Civil War, the MorningStar is one of the most capable designs available. In spite of being marketed as a planetary defense ship, the MorningStar finds its way into mercenary and pirate fleets across the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Kuat Systems Engineering originally produces the MorningStar as an orbital fighter and picket vessel for planetary defenses and law enforcement. With the eventual addition of a Class 2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},", the MorningStar is shoehorned into the role of a space superiority fighter. Though effective, especially en masse, the MorningStar suffers from light construction, mediocre maneuverability, slow speed, and an inadequate payload of concussion missiles.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Variants of the MorningStar are produced, the most popular of which are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["MorningStar-A"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MorningStar-A"},", MorningStar-B, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["MorningStar-C"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MorningStar-C"}," models. The MorningStar-B trades in its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concussion Missile Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concussion_Missile_Launcher"}," for three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Laser_Cannons"}," (Damage 7d10x2). As a result, it is favored as a dogfighting craft by the mercenaries who employ it.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["MorningStar-B Starfighter Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 13 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 22; +6 Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 70; ",{"t